metadata.prompt:
【参考图标注】
@图片1 — approved foundation image of 雲雀:
@图片1 is the sole authoritative reference for 雲雀’s identity, avian species anatomy, head, beak, eyes, crest, feather colors, body proportions, wings, legs, talons, armor, harness, scroll tube, materials and intrinsic colors. Strictly preserve @图片1 across all four panels. @图片1 provides character identity and design only; it does not provide the final layout, pose, framing, background or lighting.

No color card is used. Preserve @图片1 ’s existing colors exactly.

【角色定位】
雲雀 is a proud mythological scout bird and messenger. It has authentic avian anatomy, a compact upright body, deep crimson feathers, a white throat and belly, a large golden beak, amber-brown eyes, a swept-back flame-shaped crest, long layered wings, golden legs and black talons. It wears an engraved aged-bronze neck guard, layered bronze wing-root armor, a dark leather cross-body harness and a small bronze scroll tube.

---

【PROMPT】

A professional film-production character design sheet of the SAME character 雲雀 from @图片1 . Vertical 9:16 aspect ratio. Maximum-resolution output.

Pure solid neutral light-warm-grey studio backdrop. Thin neutral light-grey dividing lines. Single-sided side-rim backlighting from camera-right at 45 degrees behind the subject, with no front light, no fill light and no additional light sources.

【Layout】

A 2×2 grid with UNEQUAL panel heights:

- Top row: two SMALLER panels, together occupying approximately one-third of the canvas height.
- Bottom row: two LARGER panels, together occupying approximately two-thirds of the canvas height.

All four panels share the same background, lighting direction, feather treatment, armor construction and photographic quality.

【Four Panels】

Top-left — FRONT FACE CLOSE-UP:

A tight frontal portrait from the upper chest to the tips of the feather crest. 雲雀 faces the camera directly. The entire head, crest, both eyes and complete beak are visible.

Strictly preserve @图片1 : deep crimson facial feathers; swept-back flame-shaped crest composed of several distinct pointed feather groups; narrow pale-grey feather rings around the eyes; intelligent amber-brown eyes; large golden-ochre hooked beak with one nostril on each side; clean beak seam; pale ivory-white throat feathers; proud, alert and disciplined expression.

The beak is centered and symmetrical in the frontal view. Both eyes are the same size and color. The ornate upper edge of the aged-bronze neck guard may enter the bottom of the panel.

Top-right — SIDE FACE CLOSE-UP:

A tight pure side-profile portrait from the upper chest to the crest tips. 雲雀 faces camera-right, matching the authoritative facial angle from @图片1 .

Clearly show the complete side silhouette of the golden hooked beak, nostril, beak seam, amber-brown eye, pale eye ring, crimson cheek feathers, white throat, and every major crest-feather group sweeping backward.

The engraved aged-bronze neck guard is partially visible at the bottom. Preserve the same beak length, hook curvature, crest structure, eye placement and feather boundaries as the frontal portrait.

Bottom-left — BODY FRONT, NO FACE:

A complete frontal body view from the base of the neck to the tips of both talons. The entire head, beak, eyes and crest are intentionally cropped completely outside the top boundary. Zero face involvement.

Show the complete body and equipment:

- compact upright avian torso;
- ivory-white throat continuation, chest and belly plumage;
- deep crimson body feathers surrounding the white central plumage;
- both natural feathered wings folded symmetrically along the body;
- layered long crimson flight feathers;
- engraved aged-bronze neck guard visible only from its lower edge;
- matching layered bronze protective plates mounted over both wing roots;
- dark-brown leather cross-body harness;
- harness descending diagonally from the character’s LEFT shoulder area toward the RIGHT side of the lower torso;
- small cylindrical aged-bronze scroll tube attached securely at the lower chest;
- complete golden legs with realistic avian scales;
- four-toed raptor-like feet with long curved black talons.

Neutral production pose: body upright, both legs supporting equal weight, feet naturally separated, wings folded and held slightly away from the torso so the armor, harness and feather layering remain readable.

The wings remain anatomical bird wings. They are not arms and have no hands or fingers.

Bottom-right — BACK:

A complete rear full-body view from the back of the crest to the tips of both talons. 雲雀 faces directly away from the camera.

Show:

- rear construction of the swept-back crimson crest;
- complete back of the head and neck feathers;
- deep crimson dorsal plumage;
- rear surface of the engraved bronze neck guard;
- both bronze wing-root guards and their authentic attachment straps;
- dark leather harness crossing the back;
- scroll-tube fastening visible from behind;
- two folded wings with matching layered flight-feather structure;
- central dark-crimson tail feathers;
- golden scaled legs;
- black curved talons.

The back construction must be physically plausible and derived directly from the front design. The same scroll tube, harness, collar and armor must remain in the same anatomical positions.

【Subject — Same Character Across All Four Panels】

雲雀 is the same proud scout bird from @图片1 . Authentic avian anatomy: bird head, hooked beak, feather crest, feathered wings, compact torso, tail feathers, golden scaled legs and taloned feet.

Identity anchors:

1. deep crimson plumage;
2. ivory-white throat, chest and belly;
3. golden-ochre hooked beak;
4. amber-brown eyes with pale eye rings;
5. swept-back flame-shaped feather crest;
6. long layered crimson wings;
7. golden scaled legs;
8. black curved talons;
9. engraved aged-bronze neck guard;
10. matching bronze wing-root guards;
11. dark cross-body leather harness;
12. small cylindrical bronze scroll tube.

【Pose】

Default neutral production pose. Upright avian stance, both feet grounded, wings folded symmetrically and held slightly away from the torso. Alert and proud, not flying and not attacking.

【Critical Consistency】

SAME individual in all four panels. Identical beak length and curvature, nostril position, eye color, crest silhouette, feather boundaries, body volume, wing length, flight-feather count and layering, tail shape, leg length, talon structure, neck guard, wing armor, harness routing, scroll-tube position, engravings, scratches and bronze patina.

四格必须是同一个雲雀。严格继承 @图片1 ，不改变鸟喙、眼睛、羽冠、羽色边界、翅膀、腿爪、护颈、肩甲、胸带和卷轴筒。

【Lighting — Critical】

Single-sided side-rim backlighting from camera-right at 45 degrees behind the character. No front light, no fill light and no additional light sources. Controlled rim light reveals crest tips, feather edges, beak silhouette, wing layers and bronze engravings. Minimal natural bounce keeps the shadow-side materials readable.

【Style】

Hyperrealistic photographic avian character design, like a practical creature maquette photographed in a professional film-production studio. Individually visible feather barbs, natural layered plumage, matte keratin beak, realistic scaled legs, black keratin talons, worn leather and oxidized hand-engraved bronze.

Slight organic photographic softness is intentional and desired. Materials remain tactile, restrained and physically plausible.

【Panel Labels】

Top-left: “FRONT FACE”
Top-right: “SIDE FACE”
Bottom-left: “BODY FRONT — NO FACE”
Bottom-right: “BACK”

Title at top center:
“雲雀 · DEFAULT FORM CHARACTER SHEET”

【Constraints】

Vertical 9:16 canvas. Unequal four-panel layout with smaller top row and larger bottom row. Exactly four panels. Bottom-left contains absolutely no head, beak, eyes or crest. Both upper panels show the complete beak and crest. Both lower panels show the complete body down to the talon tips. Wings remain natural feathered bird wings. Same intrinsic colors as @图片1 . No color-card reinterpretation. No weapon, additional container, clothing, character or environmental background.

Avoid: equal-sized panels, square canvas, four equal full-body orthographic views, head visible in bottom-left panel, beak visible in bottom-left panel, cropped crest, cropped beak, cropped talons, changing beak length, changing crest shape, changed eye color, changed red-white feather boundary, different wing lengths, missing feathers, human arms, human hands, fingers on wings, humanoid torso, mammal anatomy, extra wings, extra legs, missing tail, scroll tube changing position, armor changing between panels, spread-wing action pose, flight pose, attack pose, branch, cave, rocks, smoke, landscape, cartoon, anime, illustration, plush feathers, glossy CGI, HDR, oversharpening, additional text, logo, signature, watermark.

